 Range: 20 ft.
 Area: 15-ft. radius

THAC0: +2, +4 vs. evil creatures
Damage: 2d4+3, +4 vs. evil creatures, does double damage against undead
Damage type: Slashing
Speed Factor: 6
Proficiency Type: Bastard Sword
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 15 Strength

Weight: 8
"




//PERIDAN +3 - valore 8000mo//
